# Copy to .env and fill in. Restart the dev server after changing it.
# Full walkthrough: supabase/README.md

# Project Settings → API in the Supabase dashboard.
#
# The anon key is public by design: it ships in the browser bundle either way,
# and Row Level Security is what actually guards the data. The service_role key
# is the secret one — it must never appear in this file.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# The Anthropic key is NOT here. Claude is called server-side, in the ai-chat
# edge function, with the key held as a Supabase secret:
#
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# A VITE_-prefixed key would ship in the public bundle and could be spent by
# anyone who opened the network tab.
